        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-SQPULL48-613, 48\" Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 48 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull has a 3 foot center to center. It has a modern, square design. This door pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Just make sure you order 2 pulls if you choose the back-to-back option. The oil rubbed bronze finish appears rich and chocolatey with no highlights. The sturdy 1-3/16 inch tubing makes it strong enough for heavy doors while still being comfortable in the hand.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SQPULL48-specifcations.gif?v=1704354514\" width=\"485\" height=\"165\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"DWDSQULL48-613 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in <a href=\"/products/48-inch-matte-black-square-ladder-pull-dwd-sqpull48-622\"><b>Matte Black Finish</b></a> and\r\n<br>\r\nOther Lengths \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-square-ladder-pull-dwd-sqpull24-613\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/3-foot-oil-rubbed-bronze-square-door-pull-dwd-sqpull36-613\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD SQULL48-613 Contemporary Matte Black Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
